ll,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310664,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA2NjQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:input","name":"topic:input","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":8,"created_at":"2026-07-26T15:43:37Z","updated_at":"2026-07-28T23:18:10Z","closed_at":"2026-07-28T23:18:07Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in:\n* v4.8.dev1.official [ebbf577a0]\n* v4.8.dev2.official [7220d456d]\n\nNot reproducible in:\n* v4.7.1.rc2.official [d6096250e] and below\n\n### System information\n\nLinux Mint - Freedesktop SDK 24.08 (Flatpak runtime) on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 9070 XT (RADV GFX1201) - AMD Ryzen 7 7800X3D 8-Core Processor (16 threads) - 30.46 Gio memory - PulseAudio (44100 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nSome key combinations are triggered twice in `_unhandled_input`, specifically `Alt+Enter`, but maybe there are more.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n* Add an action in the project settings bound to `Alt+Enter` and `F11`.\n* Press `F11` -> `is_action_pressed` is triggered once.\n* Press `Alt+Enter` -> `is_action_pressed` is triggered twice.\n\nBelow is the minimal code, which is also attached to this issue:\n```gdscript\nfunc _unhandled_input(event: InputEvent):\n\tif event.is_action_pressed(\"toggle_fullscreen\"): toggle_fullscreen()\n\n\nfunc toggle_fullscreen():\n\tif get_window().mode == Window.MODE_FULLSCREEN:\n\t\tget_window().mode = Window.MODE_WINDOWED\n\telse:\n\t\tget_window().mode = Window.MODE_FULLSCREEN\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[minimal.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/30389756/minimal.zip)\n\n---\n### EDIT\nAs @NoNormalDev has found, this has nothing to do with `_unhandled_input`. Toggling full screen with `Alt+Enter` is now the default behavior of Godot 4.8. There's no need for the dev to implement it anymore. The \"bug\" is simply caused by the conflict on the `Alt+Enter` binding.","closed_by":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121799/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121799/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}